OL,3,GNEWSAJaguar Land Rover to open
OL,4,Aredundancy scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FCar manufacturer Jaguar Land Rover
OL,7,F(JLR) has confirmed it is opening a
OL,8,Fvoluntary redundancy programme, a year
OL,9,Fon from a cyber attack which brought
OL,10,Fproduction to a halt for more than a
OL,11,Fmonth.
OL,13,FThe firm said it needed to save about
OL,14,F#1.7bn over the next two years as it
OL,15,Fseeks to adapt to "evolving global
OL,16,Fmarket conditions".
OL,18,FIt was reported by The Times on
OL,19,FSaturday that as many as 4,000 jobs may
OL,20,Fbe lost due to the impact of tariffs
OL,21,Fand a drop in sales.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
